# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  SECRETS — never commit. Copy config/api_keys.example.json instead.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
config/api_keys.json
config/*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*credentials*.json
secrets.json
secrets/
*.secret
*_session.json
*token*.json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  PERSONAL DATA — Alfred's memory of its owner never leaves the machine.
#  (semantic memory, face/voice prints, night-watch logs, cases, telemetry)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
memory/*
!memory/__init__.py
!memory/*.py
workspace/*
!workspace/.gitkeep
tts_cache/
*.jsonl
voiceprint.json
user_appearance.json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Generated / local
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.log
web_ui/qwebchannel.js
guide_assets/
ALFRED_GUIDE.md
GUIDE_ACT_III.md

# 3D model download cache — Alfred re-fetches on demand (third-party licences)
web_ui/models/*.glb
